<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GR-0014> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/supportingText> "For a trade mark to trigger section 43 there must be some connotation within the trade mark that would reasonably be expected to cause deception or confusion in the mind of the relevant buying public." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GR-0014> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/tier> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
