<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GR-0057> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/supportingText> "If a trade mark, or some part of the trade mark, contains a reference to Indigenous people and a connotation arises from the mark that would be likely to deceive or confuse consumers within the relevant market, then a ground for rejection under s43 should be raised." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/approved> .
