<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0005> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether denotation does any work of its own in an examination, or whether it appears only in the case law the Manual quotes. If the latter, none_of_these is the better answer and this record is the clearest example of the four groups not fitting."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
