<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0009> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "The line this pass drew between a population that is weighed (typed relevant_factor, as here and at GT-0010) and an actor who decides (typed none_of_these, GT-0044 to GT-0046). If that line is wrong, four records move together."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
