<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0010> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The ordinary consumer is the perspective the test is applied from, and a perspective is an input to the answer rather than a question in its own right. Typed alongside GC-0009 so the market and the consumer within it sit in the same group."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0010> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> "relevant_factor" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
