<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0013> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether 'overcoming a ground' and 'the ground not arising' are the same kind of thing. Four records — GT-0013, GT-0014, GT-0015, GT-0029 — are typed exception on the first, and GT-0020, GT-0027 and GT-0048 on the second."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
