<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0017> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringBasis> "corpus_inferred" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0017> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The corpus is explicit that the mere presence of a place name demonstrates nothing automatically — it is material that feeds the connotation question and does not answer it. That sentence is the reason this whole family of subject-matter concepts is typed relevant_factor rather than ground_of_refusal."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0017> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> "relevant_factor" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
