<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0017> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "The family judgement, once, rather than fifteen times: GT-0017 to GT-0023, GT-0025, GT-0026, GT-0030 to GT-0034, GT-0036 and GT-0037 are all typed relevant_factor because they name material rather than a reason to refuse. If that is wrong it is wrong for all of them."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
