<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0020> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether 'will rarely apply' is practice-speak for an exception or an honest statement of frequency. The distinction decides this record and nothing else."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
