<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0038> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether neutralising elements dispose of the ground or reduce it. The difference matters for GC-0021 and GC-0048 as well, both of which are about material that stops a connotation forming."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0038> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/goldRecord> "GT-0038" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
