<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0038> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/sourcePassage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part29/3/3/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
