<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0039> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoredDate> "2026-09-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
