<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0039> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "A connotation that developed through use is still a connotation, and its history is what makes it findable; typed as an input to GC-0001's question rather than as a separate one."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0039> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/conceptGroup> "relevant_factor" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
