<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0039> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "The near-miss GC-0039's record note calls the most valuable in the file: acquired distinctiveness under s 41 is described in almost identical words and must never be carried into s 43. The typing does not encode that boundary, and a relevant_factor label may make it easier to cross."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
