<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0052> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringBasis> "corpus_inferred" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
