<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0078> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether scent's connection to section 40 is strong enough that the vocabulary should hold it as a factor. If it is, the same argument reaches the other three sign kinds and the group loses four members. Whether the four sign kinds — shape, colour, sound, scent — are subject matter in their own right or facets of GC-0073 sign, which would make them narrower concepts under it rather than siblings beside it."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
