<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/assertion/GT-0079> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether 'series of trade marks' and 'divisional application' fall on the same side. This pass puts series in subject_matter and divisional in procedural_step, on the reading that a series is a thing applied for and a division is something done to an application. A reviewer who thinks both are applications should move series; one who thinks both are mechanisms should move divisional. They should be decided together."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
