<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0053> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Manual treats the grounds as a closed set fixed by the Act and Regulations. Whether a formality failure under paragraph 33(1)(a) is a 'ground for rejection' in the same sense as sections 39-44 is a real question the passage leaves open."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
