<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "grounds for rejecting"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "grounds for rejection"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
