<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0053> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringBasis> "corpus_explicit" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0053> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The Manual states in terms that the Act and Regulations contain all the grounds, and section 33(3) makes the Registrar's satisfaction that a ground exists the trigger for rejection. The concept is therefore the corpus's own, not a label imposed on it."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0053> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/confidence> "0.8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
