<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0055> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether the six prescribed types should each be a narrower concept. The Manual lists them at Part 31.4 and an examiner reasons about them individually."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
