<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0056> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A resemblance test that is not the section 44 one. The comparison is between the applicant's sign and a prescribed or prohibited sign, and the threshold is 'likely to be taken for it' rather than 'likely to deceive or cause confusion'."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "so nearly resembling as to be likely to be taken for it"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
