<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0056> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The phrase is the Act's and the Manual quotes it as the operative test for subparagraph 39(2)(b)(i). It is held as a separate concept from deceptive similarity because the two use different words for different comparisons, and collapsing them would let a section 44 authority be cited into a section 39 question."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0056> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/confidence> "0.75"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
