<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0056> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether practice in fact applies the section 10 case law to this test. If it does, the two concepts are more closely related than this record says."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
