<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0058> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The section 41 ground turns on this and nothing else; inherent adaptation and use are the two routes to it, not synonyms for it. The Manual's Part 22 is titled 'Section 41 - Capable of Distinguishing'."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
