<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0059> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Manual sets out a two-part process — ordinary signification, then the likelihood that other traders would legitimately wish to use the mark — and sorts every mark examined into one of three categories on the answer."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
