<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0060> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The Manual names it as the first step of a two-part process and ties it to the goods and services applied for. It is held apart from 'connotation' — a section 43 concept this repository already holds — because the two ask different questions of the same mark and share no statutory text."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
