<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0060> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "The relationship to connotation. An expert may see them as two names for one underlying idea applied under different sections, which would make this a 'related' rather than a distinct concept."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
