<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0061> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The corpus states the idea in terms but gives it no name, so the record is corpus_explicit as to the content and an invention as to the label. It is held because an examiner reasons with it constantly and a vocabulary without it cannot represent the second half of the Manual's own method."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
