<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0062> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "Both the Act and the Manual state the ground in one sentence. Held apart from 'use contrary to law' because paragraph 42(a) looks at what the mark contains and paragraph 42(b) at what using it would do — different evidence answers each."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
