<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0068> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The Manual states what the paragraph turns on in one sentence. Held separately from honest concurrent use because paragraph 44(3)(b) is an alternative to 44(3)(a), not a gloss on it."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
