<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0074> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The Manual devotes a Part to the category and names it in the Part title, but never defines it — so the record is corpus_inferred and says so. It is held because the grouping drives practice: these are the signs where section 40 and the representation requirements bite hardest."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
