<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "resemble each other in material particulars"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
