<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0080> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The Act uses the phrase as the operative requirement for a series. Held apart from the section 44 comparisons because it answers a different question between different parties, and because the repository now holds three resemblance tests that a reader could easily merge."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0080> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/confidence> "0.7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
