<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0081> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringBasis> "corpus_explicit" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0081> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The Manual states the concept's place in the scheme and the Act tells us where its meaning is affected. Held as one concept with the specialised uses — authorised, prior, honest concurrent — as separate records beside it, because each answers a different question under a different provision."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0081> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/confidence> "0.8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#double> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
