<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0081> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/expertShouldCheck> "Whether 'use in the course of trade' should be the preferred label. Section 17 makes the course of trade part of what a trade mark is, and the bare word 'use' may be too wide for a vocabulary that also holds authorised use and prior use."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
