<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0082> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Control by the owner is the whole of it: section 8(2) makes use authorised only to the extent the user acts under the owner's control. Section 7(3) then treats authorised use as use by the owner, which is why it matters to section 41 and section 44(4)."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
