<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0082> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "Section 8 defines it and limits it by control. Held apart from 'authorised user' because the Act defines the person in 8(1) and the use in 8(2), and evidence questions attach to the second."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
