<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0111> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A claim under the Paris Convention that moves the priority date back to an earlier foreign filing. The Manual defines 'Convention country' by two routes — Paris signatory or full WTO member — which is worth carrying because they are not the same set."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
