<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0111> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "The Manual defines the country; the application type is the mechanism built on it. The record is honest that the evidence carries the first more strongly than the second."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
