<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/concept/GC-0118> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoringReasoning> "Two passages, and they are in mild tension — Part 20.4 asserts the presumption and Part 22.2 says the expression is not in the Act. Both are quoted rather than reconciled, because the tension is the interesting part and resolving it would be authoring a position the corpus does not take."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/authored> .
