<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/allocatesTo> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedSubjectType> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Chunk>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/allocatesTo> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/usageCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/allocatesTo> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/usedBy> "GR-0006"  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/answerShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/answerShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "What a correct answer must and must not do. Not the answer — the shape of one."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/answerShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "answer shape"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/answerShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>  .
