<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/assertionPredicate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/assertionPredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation asserted, as a node. Restricted to tmk:ApprovedRelation by a shape, which is how relations.ttl stays a closed list in practice and not only in prose."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/assertionPredicate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Assertion>  .
