<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citedAuthority> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citedAuthority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Deliberately without an `rdfs:range`. 17 refs cited from the in-scope chunks land on no provision this corpus holds (recon §4); a range of tmk:LegislativeProvision would classify those targets as provisions on the strength of being cited, which is exactly the inference the unresolved list exists to prevent."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citedAuthority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Citation>  .
