<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesAuthorityFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Approved usage: 1 relationship (GR-0013), sourced to TMM/Part29."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesAuthorityFor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegalMatter>  .
