<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Manual-internal cross reference. Upstream drops targets it cannot resolve rather than recording them, so absence here is not evidence the source made no reference (Q-08)."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/citesPassage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Passage>  .
