<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The `sha256:` hash the passage carried in the pinned snapshot. When it stops matching, everything asserted over the passage is stale and returns to review (IDENTIFIERS.md §5)."@en-AU  .
