<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/document> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The addressable shapes of the corpus. Maps onto upstream's page /\nchunk / provision / unit, NOT onto an idealised chapter-section-paragraph tree.\n\nChapter and Paragraph appear in the roadmap's module list and are deliberately\nabsent here. Some Manual subsections are bold text that was never marked up as a\nheading, so `heading_path` is a retrieval signal and a weak structural guarantee\n(Q-10). The addressable unit is `chunk_ref`, and a class named Paragraph would\npromise a structure the corpus does not carry."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/document> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "TM-Knowledge — document module"@en-AU  .
