<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/extractionMethod> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A **set**, not a scalar: a term found by three extractors is one assertion with\nthree methods, because agreement across methods is the confidence signal the\nensemble exists to produce, and it is only visible if the methods land on one\nrecord (ADR-0019, ADR-0020).\n\nToday every value is `expert_elicitation` — no Stage 2 run has happened\n(ADR-0010)."@en-AU  .
