<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/lastAmended> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Manual page's own amendment note where it carries one. Page-level and self-reported — not a version stamp, and not comparable across pages."@en-AU  .
