<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/mustOccurWithin> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoredUsedBy> "GR-0706"  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/mustOccurWithin> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoredUsedBy> "GR-0707"  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/mustOccurWithin> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authoredUsedBy> "GR-0708"  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/mustOccurWithin> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedObjectType> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegislativeProvision>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/mustOccurWithin> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedSubjectType> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegalConcept>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/mustOccurWithin> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/usageCount> "0"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/notLabel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/notLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A term this concept must NOT be conflated with. There is no SKOS property for\nthis and it is the most valuable field on the record.\n\n`deceptively similar` is a not-label of `likely to deceive or cause confusion`\nbecause the two belong to different sections; a retrieval system that treats\nthem as synonyms routes an examiner to the wrong test, and the misrouting is\ninvisible because both destinations are about confusion (GX-0005)."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/notLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegalConcept>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/notLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "not label"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/notLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedObjectType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedObjectType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "As tmk:observedSubjectType, for the object."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedObjectType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "observed object type"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedSubjectType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedSubjectType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A type this predicate's subject has actually taken in the approved set, with no claim that it is the only one. An annotation, so it licenses no inference."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/observedSubjectType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "observed subject type"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Chunk>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "on page"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Page>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Position of a chunk within its page, or a unit within its provision. Reading order, nothing more."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ordinal"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/origin> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/origin> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/origin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Which store this node was built from: \"approved\" for eval/gold/, \"authored\" for authored/. Stamped on every node of both, so a triple lifted out of its named graph still says where it came from. The named graph is the governance boundary; this is the belt to its braces (ADR-0080)."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/origin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Assertion>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/origin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "origin"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/origin> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`Part29`. Comes from the nav tree by way of the ref, never from the URL — deriving it from anything else is how a chunk lands in the wrong Part (Q-09)."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Manual Part"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/performsInPractice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/performsInPractice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "AUTHORED, unreviewed, and deliberately an annotation so it licenses no inference. The bridge a later pass would need between the vocabulary's tmk:ProcessRole entry and the tmk:Role that acts. Declared and UNUSED: asserting it today would join a term to an office on nothing but the two having the same label, which is the inference Q-58 exists to prevent."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/performsInPractice> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "performs in practice"@en-AU  .
