<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/pilotInScope> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/producedByRule> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/producedByRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "'Every inferred result identifies the rule that produced it' — one of the six starting SHACL rules, and the reason a rule file carries an id."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/producedByRule> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/InferredAssertion>  .
