<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/requiresSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "requires source"@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/requiresSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Passage>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/resolvesTo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/resolvesTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Where the mention points, when it points somewhere the corpus holds. Absent on the many mentions that resolve to nothing — 'the Act' names an instrument and no provision."@en-AU  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/resolvesTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/EntityMention>  .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/resolvesTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "resolves to"@en-AU  .
