<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/reviewStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "`approved` | `candidate` | `rejected` | `stale`. Never absent, and never defaulted to `approved`."@en-AU  .
