<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s107> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) If a trade mark whose registration is being sought is assigned or transmitted: (a) the applicant for the registration of the trade mark; or (b) the person to whom it has been assigned or transmitted; must apply to the Registrar for the assignment or transmission to be recorded. (2) The application must: (a) be in an approved form; and (b) be filed, together with any prescribed document, in accordance with the regulations. Note: For approved form and file see section 6." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s107> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s107" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
