<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s108(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) On and after the day on which the Registrar records the particulars of the assignment or transmission, the person to whom the trade mark has been assigned or transmitted is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to be the applicant for the registration of the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
