<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s10> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegislativeProvision> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s10> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Definition of deceptively similar"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s10> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s10> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s10> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s10> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:267b10f0b047e6ab3212296943282612992e1bf8ca8de41a26b0891eefaa166e" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s10> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "For the purposes of this Act, a trade mark is taken to be deceptively similar to another trade mark if it so nearly resembles that other trade mark that it is likely to deceive or cause confusion." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
