<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s111> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If an application made under section 107 or 109 in relation to the assignment or transmission of a trade mark complies with this Act, the Registrar must notify in accordance with the regulations any person recorded under Part 11 as claiming an interest in, or a right in respect of, the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
