<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s120(4)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(4) In deciding, for the purposes of paragraph (3)(a), whether a trade mark is well known in Australia, one must take account of the extent to which the trade mark is known within the relevant sector of the public, whether as a result of the promotion of the trade mark or for any other reason." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
