<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s121(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s121(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) This section applies to a registered trade mark if the registered owner, or an authorised user of the trade mark having power to do so, has caused to be displayed on goods (registered goods) in respect of which the trade mark is registered, or on their package, or on the container in which they are offered to the public, a notice (notice of prohibition) prohibiting any act that is under subsection (2) a prohibited act in relation to the goods." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s121(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s121(1)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
