<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s121(1)~1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegislativeUnit> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
