<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s122(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) In spite of section 120, if a disclaimer has been registered in respect of a part of a registered trade mark, a person does not infringe the trade mark by using that part of the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
