<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s124(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) A person does not infringe a registered trade mark by using an unregistered trade mark that is substantially identical with, or deceptively similar to, the registered trade mark in relation to:" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
