<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s124(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) If the unregistered trade mark has continuously been used only in a particular area of Australia, subsection (1) applies only to the use of the trade mark by the person in that area." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
