<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s153> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Disobeying summons etc."@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s153> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
