<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Definition of originate in relation to wine"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:a3b5cb9e51ee7fee9849a3933ebf78292ddf80dedc8f802eea26518309784e1a" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s15> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "For the purposes of this Act: (a) a wine is taken to have originated in a foreign country or Australia only if the wine is made from grapes grown within the territory of that country or of Australia, as the case may be; and (b) a wine is taken to have originated in a particular region or locality of a foreign country or of Australia only if the wine is made from grapes grown in that region or locality." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
