<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s169~2~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Note: The goods or services certified may be those of any person, including the owner of the certification trade mark or any person approved by the owner for the purpose of certifying goods or services." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
