<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s170> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Subject to this Part, the provisions of this Act relating to trade marks (other than sections 8 and 26, paragraph 27(1)(b), sections 33, 34 and 41, sections 121 and 127, Part 9—Removal of trade mark from Register for nonuse and Part 17—Defensive Trade Marks) apply to certification trade marks and so apply as if a reference to a trade mark included a reference to a certification trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
