<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s176> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Acceptance or rejection of application"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
