<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s19> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s19> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:10a7d14015f9cfa1590af442f587ffa9f455d312221cd08f532bb31658683ff6" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s19> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) A trade mark may be registered in accordance with this Act in respect of: (a) goods; or (b) services; or (c) both goods and services. (2) The registration of a trade mark may be in respect of goods or services of more than one class. Note: See subsection (3) for division into classes. (3) The regulations may provide for the classes into which goods and services are to be divided for the purposes of this Act." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
