<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s214(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s214(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) A person who has filed an application, notice or request may withdraw it, in accordance with the regulations, at any time while it is still being considered by the Registrar." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
