<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Nature of registered trade mark as property"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:d31c42f09116407c8834ad4ba518e52e341cb159957a05fb1bf45a9eee56a34e" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) A registered trade mark is personal property. (2) Equities in respect of a registered trade mark may be enforced in the same way as equities in respect of any other personal property. Note: For registered trade mark see section 6." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s21> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s21" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
