<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s22(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:d91d0f4d81fd3d4f62edff6ec5363436c1378c321d5d2cba9f16d5b1274ad3f5" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s22(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) The registered owner of a trade mark may, subject only to any rights appearing in the Register to be vested in another person, deal with the trade mark as its absolute owner and give in good faith discharges for any consideration for that dealing." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
