<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s33> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Application accepted or rejected"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
