<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s37> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Lapsing of application if not accepted in time"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
