<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s39> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Trade mark containing etc. certain signs"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s39> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s39> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s39> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s39> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:5c6142286d25888ad60e7b915ee08e6b4c74dfbbc868380658b3cfbba876b358" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s39> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) An application for the registration of a trade mark must be rejected if the trade mark contains or consists of a sign that, under regulations made for the purposes of section 18, is not to be used as a trade mark. (2) An application for the registration of a trade mark may be rejected if the trade mark contains or consists of: (a) a sign that is prescribed for the purposes of this subsection; or (b) a sign so nearly resembling: (i) a sign referred to in paragraph (a); or (ii) a sign referred to in subsection (1); as to be likely to be taken for it." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
