<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s46(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) When a divisional application is made, the Registrar must, unless the parent application has lapsed, amend the parent application by excluding the goods and/or services in respect of which the divisional application is made." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
