<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "This Act extends to: (a) Christmas Island; and (b) Cocos (Keeling) Islands; and (c) Norfolk Island; and (d) the Australian continental shelf; and (e) the waters above the Australian continental shelf; and (f) the airspace above Australia and the Australian continental shelf. Note: For Australia and Australian continental shelf see section 6." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
