<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s58A(2)~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s58A(2)~1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
