<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s60> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s60> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:b981c43df6fedd1f8604c1244acb825de3192f420355bbc001f0032c2e83485c" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s60> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The registration of a trade mark in respect of particular goods or services may be opposed on the ground that: (a) another trade mark had, before the priority date for the registration of the firstmentioned trade mark in respect of those goods or services, acquired a reputation in Australia; and (b) because of the reputation of that other trade mark, the use of the firstmentioned trade mark would be likely to deceive or cause confusion. Note: For priority date see section 12." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s60> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s60" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
