<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65A(5)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(5) If the Registrar is satisfied that a request for an amendment would not be granted even in the absence of opposition under subsection (4):" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s65A(5)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s65A(5)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
