<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s66A> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s66A> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:5049e83cfd9fd73b56ad8c2749fbdbacfbfa695dbc318d5ad71686f999ac8f6c" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s66A> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The Registrar may require a request under section 63 or 66 to be in writing if the Registrar is of the opinion that the amendment requested is not minor." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s66A> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s66A" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
