<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s69(3)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(3) If 2 or more persons applied together for the registration of the trade mark (see section 28), the applicants must be registered as joint owners of the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
