<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s7(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) To avoid any doubt, it is stated that, if a trade mark consists of the following, or any combination of the following, namely, any letter, word, name or numeral, any aural representation of the trade mark is, for the purposes of this Act, a use of the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
