<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s7(3)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(3) An authorised use of a trade mark by a person (see section 8) is taken, for the purposes of this Act, to be a use of the trade mark by the owner of the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
