<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s74A> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "This Division applies to a registered trade mark if: (a) particulars of registration were entered in the Register under section 69 before the end of the period of 10 years after the filing date of the application for registration; or (b) both: (i) paragraph (a) does not apply; and (ii) registration has already been renewed under Division 3 for a period that includes the day on which particulars of registration were entered in the Register under section 69. Note: For filing date see section 6." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
