<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s75> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s75> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s75> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s75> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:1dc0ff524019451d5aed46a20b9dbd19486c9bc15e166d90d488236a8fb78328" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s75> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) Any person may, within the prescribed period before the registration of a trade mark expires, ask the Registrar to renew the registration. (2) The request must: (a) be in an approved form; and (b) be filed in accordance with the regulations." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s75> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s75" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
