<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:161e1ca3df3ec59413b60ada121eb68e1dadb08660f6934b4a4571fb278c12b5" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If the registration of a trade mark is not renewed under section 77, then: (a) subject to sections 79 and 80, the registration ceases to have effect when it expires; and (b) unless the registration is renewed under section 79, the Registrar must remove the trade mark from the Register 6 months after the day on which the registration expired. Note: For month and Register see section 6." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s78" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78~1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78~1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegislativeUnit> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:55b701c69fb471e549c637e37864945b5d86d97b4925d8d849a6f204c723dacf" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If the registration of a trade mark is not renewed under section 77, then:" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s78~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s78~1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMA1995> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/LegislativeProvision> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Renewal within 6 months after registration expires"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:c48cdda2cca86a1df958112c8017f29846bac744a44258f55795fe7d8242daa2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If, within 6 months after the registration of a trade mark has expired, a person asks the Registrar, in accordance with subsection 75(2), to renew the registration of the trade mark, the Registrar must renew the registration of the trade mark for 10 years from the day on which the registration expired. Note: For month see section 6." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s79> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s79" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
