<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s84(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s84(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) The Registrar must cancel the registration of a trade mark in accordance with the regulations if the registered owner asks in writing that the registration be cancelled." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
