<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s84A(1)(a)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s84A(1)(a)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s84A(1)(a)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:83b887b7604e53ea56395ddd2d894369fe21071b14355805bf2dc92b3d6cdf14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s84A(1)(a)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s84A(1)(a)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(a) the trade mark should not have been registered, taking account of all the circumstances that existed when the trade mark became registered (whether or not the Registrar knew then of their existence); and" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
