<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s88A~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s88A~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The Registrar must not make an application under section 86, 87 or 88 unless he or she considers the application desirable in the public interest." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s88A~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s88A~1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
