<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s97(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(2) If there is no opposition to an application to a court under subsection 92(3), the court must order the Registrar to remove the trade mark from the Register in respect of the goods and/or services specified in the application. The court must cause a copy of the order to be served on the Registrar and the Registrar must comply with the order." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMA1995/s97(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMA1995/s97(2)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
