<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/chunkKind> "body" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:b89325b31faaebcd8a406c03e5022320f0cb675db435812ab0d9cef4e8e0c8b8" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
