<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "1.1.8 Government Authorities and Commissions -" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "10.1. Formality requirements - Name" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 10 Details of Formality Requirements" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part10" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/1/1/1/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Reference should generally be made to the Commonwealth or State/Territory government that is responsible for the authority or commission, in a similar format to government departments. Where the owner is one of these entities and they have supplied an ABN which is linked to a government entity type, the name of the entity (without the ‘State of X c/o…’ format) will be acceptable." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
