<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part10" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Federal Register of Legislation - Trade Marks Regulations 1995 Federal Register of Legislation - Trade Marks Act 1995 Under the terms of paragraph 27(3)(a) of the Act, of the Act, the application must include a representation of the trade mark. Additionally, in the case of a trade mark that consists of or contains a sign that is a colour, scent, shape, sound, aspect of packaging or other kind of non-traditional sign, the application must include a concise and accurate description of the trade mark (subreg 4.3(7))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
