<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The size of the representation of the trade mark should, where practicable, be no larger than 8cm x 8cm (subreg 4.3(1)), although this limit is now of little practical relevance given most applications are filed electronically." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
