<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part10" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The representation must: show all the features of the trade mark clearly, be of a quality that ensures all the features of the trade mark will be preserved over time, and be suitable for reproduction (subreg 4.3(10))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
