<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "9"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part10" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If it is not possible for the applicant to provide a perspective or isometric drawing of the trade mark, the applicant should furnish as many views of the trade mark as will sufficiently show all the features of the trade mark (subreg 4.3(3)(b))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
