<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part10" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Where more than one view of the trade mark is filed, each representation of the trade mark should, where practicable, be no larger than 8cm x 8cm and must be attached to the application (subregs 4.3(1) and 4.3(9))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
