<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/6> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/6> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part10" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/6> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If the description or representation of the trade mark is not satisfactory in that it does not demonstrate the nature of the trade mark sufficiently or show each feature of the trade mark sufficiently, the applicant may be requested to provide a description or further description of the trade mark and a specimen of the trade mark (subreg 4.3(8)). If the description is suitable it will be entered as an endorsement of the registration. The onus lies with the applicant to provide an adequate graphical representation of their trade mark - if they cannot then the application must be rejected." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/6> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part10/3/3/2/6" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
