<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part10" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/2/7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Black and white or colour photographs of shape trade marks which have been mounted or printed on good quality A4 size paper will be acceptable as representations of the trade mark. They must, however, be able to be reproduced for the purposes of advertisement." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
