<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "10.3. Representation of the Trade Mark - General" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "3.3 Sound trade marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "3.3.4" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
