<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Trade marks consisting of or containing a scent will be indexed as the kind of sign “scent” and therefore, all scent trade marks will come up on a search of the “scent” kinds of sign. Where a trade mark contains or consists of a non-traditional sign this will also be identified on the first screen in the enquiries facility." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
