<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If the description or representation of the trade mark is not satisfactory in that it does not demonstrate the nature of the trade mark sufficiently or show each feature of the trade mark sufficiently, the applicant may be requested to provide a description or further description of the trade mark and a specimen of the trade mark (subreg 4.3(8))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
