<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "If the applicant is claiming a texture as a trade mark, this must be made clear on the application form. An example of the actual texture claimed must be provided as well as a clear description of the texture and how it is to be used as a trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
