<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "31"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part10" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/3/3/7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Overseas jurisdictions have received applications for tastes and textures as trade marks. These kinds of applications must meet the same requirements as any other trade mark application. They will be indexed according to the content of their descriptions." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
