<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/5/5/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A class number must be nominated for each group of goods and/or services (subreg 4.4(4)). Where the application is in respect of more than one class the goods and/or services must be grouped together according to class number and the groups of goods and/or services must be presented in ascending numerical order of the class number (subregs 4.4(3) and (5))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
