<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/5/5/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Under the provisions of subregulation 4.8(3) the Registrar has the discretion to query broad claims for goods and services. This discretion will not usually be exercised." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
