<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part10/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "10.5. Specification of goods and/or services" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
