<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/hasCitation> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/cite/TMM/Part11/1/1/3/prov/0> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
