<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/1/1/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/1/1/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part11" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/1/1/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The convention application must be for the same trade mark as the trade mark of the earlier application." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
