<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "11.7. Effect on registration of a claim for priority based on an earlier application" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "7.1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 11 Convention Applications" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part11" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Under subsection 72(2) the registration of a trade mark will have effect, where a convention claim applies in respect of particular goods and/or services, from (and including) the day on which application in the Convention country was made in respect of those particular goods and/or services. Where an application was made in respect of the same goods and/or services in more than one Convention country, registration of the trade mark will have effect from (and including) the day on which the earliest of those applications was made." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part11/7/7/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMM> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part11/7/7/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Chunk> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
