<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part12/3/3/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part12/3/3/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part12" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part12/3/3/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A divisional application may not be filed for International Registrations Designating Australia (IRDAs). Sections 45 and 46 refer to divisionals being made in respect of applications for registration. An IRDA is a request for extension of protection in Australia and not an application for registration." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
