<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/1%231~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "14.1. The purpose of classification" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/1%231~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 14 Classification of Goods and Services" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
