<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/10/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/10/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/10/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Requests to substitute one class for another need to be considered carefully since it may result in an extension of the owner’s rights." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/10/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part14/4/4/10/3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
