<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/11> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "14.4. Classification procedures in examination" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/11> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.11 Goods claimed in a services class, or services claimed in a goods class" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/11> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 14 Classification of Goods and Services" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/11> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/11> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "31"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/11> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/11> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Paragraphs 4.7 to 4.10 deal predominantly with the classification of goods in goods classes, and services in services classes. Classification issues can also arise however between these two groups of classes. Such issues will fall generally in one of two categories." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/11> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part14/4/4/11" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
