<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Once the details of the application have been published, amendments to the specification are only possible under s65(4), 65(5) and 65A of the Act. Part 9 Amendments and Changes to Name and Address - 4. Amendments after particulars of an application have been published." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
