<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Section 65(7) amendments relate to any other particulars in the application. Amendments made under this subsection must not extend the scope of the goods and/or services covered by the application immediately prior to the amendment." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
