<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.3 Differences in examination practice for first and further reports" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
