<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "All terms used to specify the goods and/or services for which registration is sought must be clear and easily understood. Terms found in the NICE classification or the picklist (reg 4.4(6)) will be accepted without question. Other terms are acceptable if they can be found in mainstream or specialist dictionaries, or are easily understood terms common to particular trades." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
