<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/7/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Chunk> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
