<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/4/4/8/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Any change that occurs to the classes covered by an application must be entered on the trade mark database as soon as possible." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
