<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "14.6. Wording of the specification" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "6.1 General considerations" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 14 Classification of Goods and Services" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The need for a clear and unambiguous specification of the goods and services covered by an application has been referred to in 14.3. The requirements under the legislation are clearly prescribed in regulation 4.4 and applicants should comply with these requirements when filing applications. The primary requirement however is for clarity. Bearing in mind the matters raised in paragraphs 6.2 and 6.3, if it is clear what the application covers, and if the goods or services as specified can be classified, the specification should not be questioned." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part14/6/6/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
