<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "No question should be raised on the use of these and similar terms where they are suitably qualified, e.g. Heating apparatus, Measuring instruments, Mining equipment, Computer systems" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part14/6/6/2/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
