<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "practice" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
