<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "6.4 Wording of exclusions and restrictions" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "6.4.2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 14 Classification of Goods and Services" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "An exclusion is not acceptable if it attempts to exclude goods and/or services which are not actually included in the original specification. The usual form of exclusion uses the words “but not including” or “none being” as in the following examples: Class 7: Washing machines and spin driers; but not including any such goods for domestic use. Class 16: Articles of stationery, paint brushes, typewriters; but not including adhesives. Class 30: Pies; flans; pasties; none being foods containing pork. Class 41: Providing courses of instruction, examination services and arranging of seminars, all at tertiary level; but not including any such services relating to laboratory research." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part14/6/6/4/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
