<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A specification may be restricted, or an endorsement limiting the use of the trade mark may be entered, to ensure that in use the trade mark will not be deceptive or confusing. Part 29 Trade Marks likely to Deceive or Cause Confusion" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
