<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part14" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part14/6/6/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Claims for the current class headings are acceptable in their entirety, as are claims for self-contained parts of the class headings. For example, based on the class heading for class 42 which includes industrial analysis, industrial research and industrial design services; a claim for industrial research services would be acceptable in class 42. A claim for research services would not be acceptable." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
