<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.2 Circumstances beyond the control of the person concerned" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
