<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part15" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "This provision is equivalent to paragraph 131(1)(a) of the 1955 Act. The scope of that provision was considered in Atomic Skifabrik Alois Rohrmoser v Registrar of Trade Marks (1987) 7 IPR 551 at 558 (FC), the case providing guidance on interpretation of \"circumstances beyond the control of the person concerned\"." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part15/4/4/2/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
