<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The situations encompassed by this provision would cover circumstances which neither the person nor his or her agent could prevent, including occurrences such as the following: wars and terrorism, industrial action (strikes, lockouts), machinery breakdowns, arson and vandalism, and the forces of nature such as storms, earthquakes and floods" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part15/4/4/2/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
