<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part15" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "This is a force majeure provision and the grant of an extension of time on these grounds is discretionary." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
