<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/6%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/6%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part15" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part15/6%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Applications for extensions of time of more than three months under subsections 224(2) or (3) must be published for opposition (subsections 224(5) and (6) and regs 21.20A to 21.20G). The Registrar is required to publish the application whether or not he or she intends to allow the extension and no preliminary decision will be made prior to publication." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
