<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "1.3 Period of extension under section 224" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 16 Time Limits for Acceptance of an Application for Registration" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 16.1. What are the time limits for acceptance of an application to register a trade mark?" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part16" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "After 21 months, the application may only be extended under the provisions of section 224. Except for extensions granted because of the Registrar’s error or omission, the particular provisions require, in addition to a written request in an approved form, (and the appropriate fee) a declaration setting out the facts upon which the grounds specified in the application for an extension of time are based (regulation 21.25). This declaration will be considered by the Registrar, who has the discretion not to extend the time, if he or she does not consider the reasons for the application for an extension of time to be sufficient." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part16/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part16/1/1/3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
