<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/hasCitation> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/cite/TMM/Part17/2%231/prov/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "17.2. Circumstances under which deferments will be granted" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 17 Deferment of Acceptance" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part17" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Deferments will be available, in specific circumstances, either on the applicant's request or on the initiative of the Registrar. The period of deferment will depend on the ground of deferment. The discretion as to whether deferment is granted, except in the case of matters being sent to the Australian Competition and Consumer Commission (ACCC), lies with the Registrar (section 36 and subreg 4.14(4))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part17/2#1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
