<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.1 Deferment process where a cited trade mark application is the basis of deferment" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part17/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 17 Deferment of Acceptance" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
