<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part19A/2/2/2~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/hasCitation> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/cite/TMM/Part19A/2/2/2~2/prov/0> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
