<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part19A/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part19A/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part19A" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part19A/2/2/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "It is not possible to list exhaustively all situations in which use ‘as a trade mark’ will or will not occur. However, the cases provide some illustrative examples." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
