<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part19A/2/examples-where-use-as-a-trade-mark-found~4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Examples where use as a trade mark found" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
