<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/3/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part20" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/3/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "There is no further reference to “sound” in the Act so that no guidance as to practice in relation to trade marks consisting of sounds is to be gained from the Act itself. An aural representation of a trade mark consisting of any letter, word, name, numeral or combination of these is use of the trade mark according to subsection 7(2) of the Act." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
