<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/3/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part20" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/3/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "“Packaging” is referred to in subsections 9(2) and 121(2) dealing with the application of a trade mark to goods and infringement, respectively. These provisions therefore give no guidance as to the registrability of trade marks consisting of the packaging of goods or any “aspect of packaging”." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
