<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:d038cd0a5414fad209e7c46e95f9026654f04ef93c0933ae278a51a377ece44a" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "20.4. Presumption of registrability" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 20 Definition of a Trade Mark and Presumption of Registrability" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part20" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The presumption of registrability applies when the Registrar or their delegate is not satisfied that any grounds for rejecting a trade mark application exist. If this is the case, the application must be accepted for possible registration provided it is otherwise in accord with the Act and Regulations." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part20/4/4/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/4/4/2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMM> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
