<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part20/5/5/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "practice" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
