<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part21/3/3/9~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "practice" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
