<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part21/4/4/3/1~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.3.1 Single colour applied to the goods." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part21/4/4/3/1~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 21 Non-traditional Signs" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
