<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part21/7/7/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "21.7. Scent trade marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part21/7/7/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "7.2 Registrability of scents as trade marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
