<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/13%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Some words are commonly used in combination to identify the nature or extol the virtues of a particular product or service. These include:" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
