<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/13/13/6~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part22" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/13/13/6~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Trade marks containing a unit of time such as DAY, WEEK or MONTH in combination with a word or expression that defines, describes or indicates a particular field of interest or activity may lack the inherent adaptation to distinguish particular goods and or services. For example:" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
