<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 22 Section 41 - Capable of Distinguishing" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
