<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part22" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "When assessing the registrability of geographical names we need to assess whether (i) the sign conveys the significance of the geographical name when applied to the goods or services claimed, and (ii) if so, is it likely other traders would desire to use it for this significance?" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part22/15#1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15/15/10> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMM> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
