<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15/15/7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part22" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15/15/7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Some towns have come to prominence purely because a particular company has established itself there and has been responsible for its growth and subsequent reputation. If evidence demonstrates that the town’s reputation originates from its business, acceptance for registration may be possible." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
