<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15/applications-for-goods> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:d5a9bc783bea0edfceb6f880d24826a05c9509f127cc790d58e59d552ffc71cb" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
