<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/15/endonyms> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:1e630f14efdd634ed559a8da56fd706daefd11508986a88ace8a4361549e8e69" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
