<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/16/16/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "16.5 Word which is both a surname and a geographical name" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/16/16/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 22 Section 41 - Capable of Distinguishing" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/16/16/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/16> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/16/16/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/16/16/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part22" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/16/16/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A word which is both a surname and a geographical name will be assessed against the registrability guidelines for both surnames and geographical names (see paragraph 15 of this Part)." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/16/16/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part22/16/16/5" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
