<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part22" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "When considering whether the name of a person is inherently capable of distinguishing, the factors identified at 22.16 are relevant and need to be taken into account." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
