<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/17/17/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "17.3 Trade marks consisting of surnames and single uncommon initials" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
