<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/hasCitation> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/cite/TMM/Part22/24/24/1/prov/0> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "22.24. Trade marks for pharmaceutical or veterinary substances" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "24.1 Section 41 ground for rejection in relation to INNs" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 22 Section 41 - Capable of Distinguishing" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part22" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A ground for rejection under section 41 is appropriate where a trade mark to be used in relation to pharmaceuticals or veterinary substances is identical or confusingly similar to a notified INN. This is because an INN is effectively the generic name for a substance and is therefore something which other traders are likely to want to use on or in connection with their own goods." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/24/24/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part22/24/24/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
