<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/25/25/6> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/hasCitation> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/cite/TMM/Part22/25/25/6/case/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
