<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part22/6%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "22.6. Trade marks having no inherent adaptation to distinguish" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
