<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part23" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The declaration is usually made by the applicant (if an individual), a senior officer, or an employee of the applicant company, but the Registrar will consider a declaration from anyone who declares themselves authorised to make it on behalf of the applicant. Generally, more weight is given to declarations made by persons in a position to have first-hand knowledge or direct access to records of a company that relate to the use of the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
