<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 23 Overcoming Grounds for Rejection under Section 41 - including Evidence of Use" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 23.3. Evidence of use - general requirements" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part23" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Evidence of use of the trade mark may be submitted: prior to examination in the course of examination prior to a hearing." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/3/3/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part23/3/3/3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
