<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/6%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part23" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part23/6%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Trade Marks Act 1995 Trade Mark Regulations 1995 If an application is accepted on the basis of evidence or other circumstances, the relevant endorsement will be entered on the Register. For applications with a filing date prior to 15 April 2013 the relevant endorsement is: Provisions of subsection 41(5) applied OR Provisions of subsection 41(6) applied For applications with a filing date on or after 15 April 2013 the relevant endorsement is: Evidence provided under subsection 41(3) OR Evidence and/or other circumstances provided under subsection 41(4)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
