<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/4/4/3/1~4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 26 Section 44 and Regulation 4.15A - Conflict with Other Signs" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
