<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/5%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part26" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/5%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The existence of grounds for rejection under section 44 will depend on whether the trade marks under consideration are “substantially identical” or “deceptively similar”." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
