<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/6%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part26" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/6%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The following principles have been developed over many years from the case law and decisions of the Registrar. In each case, the nature of the trade marks will determine the criteria which will be most appropriate to determine whether they are deceptively similar." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
