<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/6/6/1~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "26.6. Factors to consider when comparing trade marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/6/6/1~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "6.1 Sound as well as appearance to be considered" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/6/6/1~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 26 Section 44 and Regulation 4.15A - Conflict with Other Signs" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
