<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/8%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:ad90c77f0c675729513ba3745bce375c49678218d81ebfd400b070804e511cc0" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/8%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "26.8. Assignment of applications and registrations" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/8%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 26 Section 44 and Regulation 4.15A - Conflict with Other Signs" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/8%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/8> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/8%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/8%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part26" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part26/8%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Under the legislation, there are provisions for the full or partial assignment of registered trade marks and applications to register a trade mark. Furthermore there is no examination made by the Registrar to ensure that trade marks which may be deceptive or confusing if applied to similar goods or services, or closely related goods or services are not separately assigned. Therefore, there is the potential for applications or registrations which were previously in the name of the applicant to become citations before examination of an application is finalised." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
