<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "3.2 Excluding goods and/or services from the application" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "3.2.2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 27 Overcoming Grounds for Rejection under Section 44" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part27" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Proposed exclusions should be considered carefully to ensure that they do differentiate the goods and/or services. The following exclusion would not be allowable, since a transistor remains the same whether or not it is used in electronics or for other purposes. Class 9 application Class 9 citation Unsuitable exclusion Electronic transistors Sound recordings and sound reproducing apparatus and parts and fittings therefor \"...but not including any such goods for recording or reproducing sound\"" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part27/3/3/2/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
