<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "27.4. Negotiation with owner/s of conflicting trade mark/s" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.1 Amendment of the conflicting application or registration" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 27 Overcoming Grounds for Rejection under Section 44" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part27" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "In order to overcome grounds for rejection under s 44 an applicant may seek to negotiate with the owner of the conflicting trade mark to amend the goods or services of that trade mark. If agreeable, the owner of the conflicting trade mark will apply to amend the specification of goods or services under the provisions of s 65(7) of the Act in the case of a pending application, and s 83 in respect of a registered trade mark. It is the responsibility of the applicant for registration to notify the office when the application for amendment has been made and allowed. Any amendment of the specification in the conflicting trade mark and, if necessary, of the application as well, must be clear and unambiguous." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part27/4/4/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
