<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part27" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Where the owner of the conflicting trade mark is a deregistered company or is a company in liquidation, ASIC becomes the vested owner of the trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
