<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.4 Assignment of the application or conflicting trade mark" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 27 Overcoming Grounds for Rejection under Section 44" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "12"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part27" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The grounds for rejection under s 44 may be withdrawn if the owner of the application and the owner of the conflicting trade mark come to an agreement where one party will assume ownership of both the trade marks. An application to record the assignment or transfer must be made under s 106 of the Act. Assignment can apply to pending or registered trade marks. A partial assignment may be possible if the conflict between the trade marks is only in respect of some of the classes nominated. The applicant must notify the Registrar when this has been actioned. Examiners must ensure that the partial assignment encompasses all the goods/services that are likely to cause conflict with the application before withdrawing the grounds for rejection. Part 43 Assignment and Transmission Part 60 The Madrid Protocol - 4.24 Change in Ownership of an International Registration" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part27/4/4/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part27/4/4/4" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
