<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "28.3. Examining evidence of honest concurrent use - the five criteria" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "3.6 Summary of information requirements for honest concurrent use" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 28 Honest Concurrent Use, Prior Use or Other Circumstances" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "18"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part28" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The evidence must be presented in declaratory form by the applicant or by a competent member of the applicant organisation. Supporting declarations from members of the trade are not usually necessary. However, there may be occasions when evidence from members of the trade will be the factor that turns the case in favour of acceptance. An example would be where the likelihood of confusion between the marks is very high, and where use is limited in time and turnover, but where the goods or services are specialised. In such a case the evidence within the supporting declarations could support a claim that within the context of the specialist area there has been satisfactory concurrent use." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part28/3/3/6~3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
