<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part29/6/6/2~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/hasCitation> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/cite/TMM/Part29/6/6/2~1/internal/0> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
