<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part30" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/2%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "An application for the registration of a trade mark must be rejected if it contains or consists of scandalous matter (section 42(a))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
