<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/3%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/3%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part30" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/3%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Under section 42(b), an application for registration of a trade mark must be rejected if use of the trade mark would be contrary to law." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part30/3%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part30/3#1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
