<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/4/4/2/2~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.2.2 Commonwealth of Australia: Australian Flags" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
