<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/4/4/2/2~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/4/4/2/2~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/4/4/2/2~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part31" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/4/4/2/2~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Grounds for rejection under section 43 of the Act may need to be considered if, in the context of the trade mark as a whole, the Australian National Flag connotes a quality of the goods or services, and consumers would be likely to be confused as a result. For more information, see Part 29.9 of this manual. Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander flags Published guidance on commercial use of the Australian National flag informs practice in relation to the Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander flags. In exercising the Registrar’s discretion in relation to flags which nearly resemble the Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander flags, consideration is given to whether the flag is used in a dignified manner, remains uncovered, and is reproduced accurately and respectfully. It may be appropriate to raise a ground for rejection where the flags are defaced, distorted, incomplete, or where incorrect colours are used. Examiners should consult the IK SME group in relation to any applications which contain the Aboriginal or Torres Strait Islander flags or similar images. Note: The Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander flags are protected by the Copyright Act (contrary to law under section 42 of the Trade Marks Act 1995) – please see Part 30.3.4 - Signs that are Scandalous and Contrary to law for more information." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/4/4/2/2~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part31/4/4/2/2~2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
