<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "31.5. Other information relevant to examining trade marks that contain a prohibited and prescribed sign" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "5.2 Section 44 does not apply to a -9000000 sign" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 31 Prescribed and Prohibited Signs" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part31" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Signs recorded in the database as -9000000 signs are not \"trade marks\", but prohibited or prescribed signs or are contrary to law. Therefore, section 44 does not apply. However if, as is sometimes the case, the owner of the prohibited or prescribed sign also has a registration for that sign as a trade mark, section 44 may apply to the registered trade mark, not the -9000000 sign." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part31/5/5/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part31/5/5/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
