<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/1/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "1.4 Glossary of terms used in this chapter" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/1/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32A.1. Introduction" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
