<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/2/2/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The prescribed sign may be removed from the trade mark if removal does not substantially alter the identity of the mark under section 65 of the Trade Marks Act." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
