<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.3.2 Descriptive words which are common to the trade" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32A.2.3 Section 41: Capacity to Distinguish" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 32A Examination of Trade Marks for Plants (in Class 31)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "7"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part32A" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Plant names may include descriptive references which are in common use. These add very little if any inherent adaptation to distinguish a trade mark in which they are used. Such references include colours (red, green, magenta, tangerine, etc) seasons (Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter) sizes (mini, dwarf, giant, etc) bloom type (double, single) A ground for rejection under section 41(4) is applicable if research identifies a plant name of the relevant type that only differs from the applied for trade mark by words that are common to the trade. The trade mark as a whole would be material that others may think to use without improper motive." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part32A/2/3/2/3/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
