<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32B.2.1 Section 42: Contrary to Law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 32B Examination of Trade Marks for Wines (in Class 33)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part32B" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Trade Marks Act 1995 Trade Mark Regulations 1995 Wine Australia Act 2013 A ground for rejection under this section may apply when a trade mark or part of a trade mark is identical to, or resembles, an entry on the Register of Protected Geographical Indications and Other Terms (‘the Wine Register’) , and the application claims grape products relevant to Class 33. The presence of such a match on the Wine Register indicates that the use of the trade mark may contravene the Wine Australia Act, unless that use is in accord with conditions specified in the relevant entry on the Wine Register. To be satisfied that use of the trade mark will comply with the provisions of the Wine Australia Act, the Registrar will require the applicant to consent to the following condition of registration: It is a condition of registration that the trade mark will only be used under the conditions entered on the Register of Protected Geographical Indications and Other Terms for use of the <Geographical Indication/ Traditional Expression/ Quality Wine Term/ Additional Term> <> and that the use will accord with the Wine Australia Act 2013. Consent to this endorsement will allow the section 42 ground for rejection to be withdrawn." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part32B/2/1#1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
