<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.1.4 Geographic Locations which are under determination as a GI" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32B.2.1 Section 42: Contrary to Law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 32B Examination of Trade Marks for Wines (in Class 33)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "5"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part32B" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Pending applications for inclusion on the Wine Register have no level of protection under the Wine Australia Act until they are on the Wine Register as a protected term. When a word is under consideration by the GIC for inclusion on the Wine Register as a protected term, there is no basis to raise a section 42(b) ground for rejection. The examiner will continue to examine the trade mark’s capacity to satisfy the other provisions of the Trade Marks Act 1995." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/4" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/5> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMM> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/1/2/1/5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Chunk> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
