<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.3.2 Geographic locations in trade marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32B.2.3 Section 41: Capacity to Distinguish" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 32B Examination of Trade Marks for Wines (in Class 33)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part32B" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Trade mark applications containing geographical locations as a main identifying feature where that geographical location is a known wine growing area will face a section 41 ground for rejection. LEETON WINE In this example, LEETON is not a GI – but it is located within the “Big Rivers” GI where there are a number of vineyards. LEETON WINE has no inherent adaptation to distinguish wine products and would face a ground for rejection under section 41(6) or 41(3) for trade mark applications with a filing date on or after 15 April 2013." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/3/2/3/3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMM> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
