<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32B.2.4 Section 44: Comparison of Trade Marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 32B Examination of Trade Marks for Wines (in Class 33)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part32B" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Trade Marks Act 1995 Trade Mark Regulations 1995 Wine Australia Act 2013 The usual practice and procedure for s 44 applies to wine trade marks. Note that words which have a specific meaning in relation to wine, or words which are common to the trade will be taken into consideration." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part32B/2/4#1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
