<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part32B/2/4/2/4/1~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "32B.2.4 Section 44: Comparison of Trade Marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
