<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Section 164 states: An application for the registration of a collective trade mark must be made by the association to which the mark belongs." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
