<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part33" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A collective trade mark can only be owned by an association. The following are examples of entities that are not an association and therefore cannot own a collective trade mark: an individual or individuals proprietary company limited by shares" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part33/1/1/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
