<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:7c680640eebf3bdb5b07c2d5b2b4f56a2014a1dad35bdcffdf494fae66eea3a4" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "1.3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "33.1. What is a collective trademark?" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 33 Collective Trade Marks" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part33" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "To apply for registration of a collective trade mark the association applying may be an incorporated or unincorporated body. Prior to 27 March 2007, collective trade marks could only be owned by an association that was not incorporated. Sections of the Act relating to collective trade marks always refer to members (plural) of the association, and according to its ordinary definition an association cannot exist with only one member. This is implicit in the meaning of collective." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part33/1/1/3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
