<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part33" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "An association is defined in business and general dictionaries as: An organisation of people with a common purpose and formal structure Macquarie Dictionary (Macquarie Library, 5th ed., 2009)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part33/1/1/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part33/1/1/4" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
