<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part34/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part34" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part34/4%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Trade Marks Act 1995 Trade Mark Regulations 1995 Section 33 of the Act applies in full to defensive trade marks. The Registrar must accept an application for a defensive trade mark unless satisfied that the application has not been made in accordance with the Act, or that there are grounds for rejecting it." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
