<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part34/4/4/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "These are basically the same as for “standard” trade mark applications. The applicant should also state the number of the trade mark registration upon which the application for defensive registration is based. The application may be based on more than one registration, particularly if the application for registration of the defensive trade mark is multi-class. This information will be captured in Australian Trade Mark Search and RIO Search in the field “Defensive details”." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
