<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part35/3%231~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part35" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part35/3%231~2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "3.8 Part 9 of the Act relates to the removal of a trade mark from the Register for non-use. It is not applicable to certification trade marks because they do not have to be used by the registered owner. It is also not in the public interest to insist that a certification trade mark be used where the certification body may have decided that none of the goods or services for which certification was sought met the certification standard. 3.9 Part 17 of the Act, the subject of which is defensive trade marks, does not apply to certification trade marks." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
