<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part38/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part38" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part38/1%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The acceptance of an application can be revoked if information is received after acceptance that indicates the trade mark should not have been accepted." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
