<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 39 Registration of a Trade Mark" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 39.4. Timing" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part39" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "There is no fee to register a trade mark, other than the initial application costs. However, applications lodged prior to Monday 10 October 2016, will still need to pay a registration fee. The registration fee can be paid at any time prior to the registration of a trade mark. It is however, expedient for this registration fee to be paid as soon as possible after acceptance of the trade mark application, so that registration may occur within 10 working days after the end of the opposition period (subject to no opposition having been filed)." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part39/4/4/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
