<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 39.4. Timing" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part39" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Subregulation 7.1(2) provides for the final date for the registration of a trade mark to be extended (without fee) by either a prescribed court or the Administrative Review Tribunal, if there are proceedings relating to the trade mark before them at the time." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
