<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part39/4/4/5> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Subregulation 7.1 also provides for the Registrar to extend the registration period in cases where the applicant has died. This extension may be for twelve months, or longer as the Registrar directs (paragraph 7.1(1)(b))." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
