<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part43/1%231~3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 43 Assignment and Transmission" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
