<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4/4/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4/4/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4/4/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part46" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4/4/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The use relied upon must have occurred in Australia before the applicant’s use of its trade mark or before the filing date of the opposed application, whichever is the earlier. It must be use as a trade mark by a person other than the applicant or the applicant’s predecessor in title (Moorgate Tobacco Co Ltd v Philip Morris Ltd (No 2) (1984) 156 CLR 414). Part 19A Use of a Trade Mark" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4/4/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part46/4/4/1/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
