<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4/4/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.1.2 The same or substantially the same trade mark" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4/4/1/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 46 Grounds for Opposition to Registration or Protection" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
