<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part46/4/4/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "practice" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
