<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part47" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The notice of intention to oppose comprises the first part of the notice of opposition. The notice of opposition must be completed by filing a statement of grounds and particulars. Together, the notice of intention to oppose and the statement of grounds and particulars form a valid notice of opposition (regs 5.5, 17A.32)." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
