<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "1.3.4 Reasons for refusing the extension" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 47 Procedures for Opposing Registration or Protection" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 47.1. Filing a notice of opposition" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part47" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Reasons for refusing extension requests may include the following: the facts contained in the declaration do not support, or make out, the grounds set out in the application. In the event of a late extension being applied for, the reasons provided in terms of regs 5.10(2) or 17A.34D(2) may not satisfy the Registrar that the application could not have been made before the end of the period." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part47/1/1/3/4" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
