<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 49 Non-use Procedures" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 49.2. Opposition to non-use application" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part49" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Any person may oppose the non-use application by filing a notice of intention to oppose within two months from the day on which the non-use application is published (regs 9.8(1), 17A.48G(1)). If the notice of intention to oppose is filed after that period has expired and no application has been made to extend that period (regs 9.11, 17A.48L), the notice will be returned to the potential opponent with an explanation that the opposition period has ended. If the notice of intention to oppose is filed before the non-use application has been published, it will be deemed not filed (reg 21.4) and returned to the potential opponent with an explanation that the notice cannot be filed until publication has occurred and the opposition period has commenced." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part49/2/2/1/1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
