<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.1 Notice of intention to oppose" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 49 Non-use Procedures" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 49.2. Opposition to non-use application" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "2"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part49" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A notice of intention to oppose comprises the first part of the notice of opposition to the non-use application. The notice of opposition is completed by the filing of a statement of grounds and particulars. Together, the notice of intention to oppose and the statement of grounds and particulars form a valid notice of opposition (regs 9.7, 17A.48F)." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
