<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The statement of grounds and particulars must be filed in an approved form. A statement of grounds and particulars form is available on IP Australia’s website. It is not a requirement that this form be used, however it is a useful guide to ensure the statement of grounds and particulars is filed in an approved form. There is no fee associated with filing a statement of grounds and particulars." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
