<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.3.4 Reasons for refusing the extension" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 49 Non-use Procedures" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 49.2. Opposition to non-use application" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part49" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Reasons for refusing extension requests may include the finding that the facts contained in the supporting declaration do not establish the grounds set out in the application. In the event of a late extension being applied for, the reasons provided in terms of regs 9.12(2) or 17A.48M(2) may not satisfy the Registrar that the application could not have been made before the end of the period." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part49/2/2/3/4" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
