<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part49/2/2/3/6> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The procedure in relation to granting or refusing an extension of time to file a notice of intention to oppose or a statement of grounds and particulars in a non-use opposition is the same as the procedure in relation to such extensions in oppositions to registration or protection. Part 47 Procedures for Opposing Registration or Protection – 1.3 Extension of time to file a notice of intention to oppose or a statement of grounds and particulars" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
