<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Chunk> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "practice" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/chunkKind> "body" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:f75f4b87ca16cfae0c62ad8836e97433942abdb2f87b759f63b137de88baa6c2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.2 Service of summons" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 54 Subpoenas, Summonses and Production of Documents" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 54.2. Summonsing a witness" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part54" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "Normally, service of the summons is the responsibility of the requesting party, and the Registrar will forward the summons to the requesting party for service to be effected. The summons must be served on the person in sufficient time to enable them reasonably to make arrangements to attend the hearing. The party serving the summons is to advise the Registrar of the date of service of the summons as soon as practicable after its service." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part54/2/2/2" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
