<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/hasCitation> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/cite/TMM/Part54/2/2/3/prov/0> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/hasCitation> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/cite/TMM/Part54/2/2/3/prov/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "2.3 Non-compliance with summons" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 54 Subpoenas, Summonses and Production of Documents" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 54.2. Summonsing a witness" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "6"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part54" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "The failure of a witness to appear is the subject of section 153(1) of the Act, which provides “A person: a. who has been summonsed to appear as a witness before the Registrar: and b. to whom a reasonable sum has been tendered in payment for expenses; must not fail to appear in answer to the summons. Penalty: 10 penalty units.1” Section 153(2A) provides that a person must comply with a summons unless there is a “reasonable excuse” for not doing so." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part54/2/2/3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/4> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMM> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Chunk> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part54/2/2/4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "practice" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
