<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "practice" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
