<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:5bc5429584894adea28c4a56bfd1e0aa540af735f69419c5ca04c967e526fcae" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "1.3 What are the Benefits?" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "60.1. Introduction" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 60 The Madrid Protocol" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part60" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A centralised international registration system is often cheaper and simpler than filing separate applications in each country. Under the Protocol Australian manufacturers and service providers with overseas interests can seek to protect their trade marks in a number of countries or intergovernmental organisations with one application. In the majority of cases a single request accompanied by the relevant fees is all that is required to make changes to, and renew international registrations." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/1/1/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part60/1/1/3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
