<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.24.3 Change in Ownership of an IRDA or Protected International Trade Mark" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "60.4.24 Change in Ownership of an International Registration" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 60 The Madrid Protocol" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/onPage> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "3"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/partId> "Part60" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "When the IB is advised of a change in ownership of an international registration, they record the change and notify all affected designated countries." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/3" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
