<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "4.24.4.2 Collective IRDA or Protected International Trade Mark" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part60/4/24/4/24/4/2> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "60.4.24 Change in Ownership of an International Registration" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
