<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part62/3%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "62.3. Factors to be taken into account before deciding whether revocation of registration is reasonable" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part62/3%231> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "Part 62 Revocation of Registration" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
