<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMM/Part9/2%231~1> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/headingPath> "9.2. Amendment of an application for a registration of a trade mark - general information" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
