<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r16.12(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r16.12(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) The Registrar must publish the rules governing the use of the certification trade mark as soon as practicable after a copy of the rules is filed in accordance with subsection 173(1) of the Act." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r16.12(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r16.12(1)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
