<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r16.12(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r16.12(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r16.12(2)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:4b2aaf7f5596540b269a2b3935e512fd0317d319de71b7e519101617374df71f" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
