<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.42A(5)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(5) The Registrar does not have a duty to consider whether or not to exercise a power under this Subdivision, whether or not the Registrar has been requested to do so." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
