<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48B(4)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(4) The Registrar must notify the parties of the Registrar’s decision." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48B(4)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r17A.48B(4)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
