<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48C(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48C(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) A person may make an application for cessation of protection." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48C(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r17A.48C(1)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
