<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48C> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48C> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:3b0916cf7de23bba32d3fdaa88616e9b13a4e160dc5cef4e3d7724559312cb93" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48C> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) A person may make an application for cessation of protection. (2) However, an application may not be made under subregulation (1) if an action concerning the protected international trade mark is pending in a prescribed court. (3) If subregulation (2) applies, a person may apply to the court for an order directing the Registrar to cease protecting the protected international trade mark." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48C> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r17A.48C" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
