<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48F> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:a2b8eade1352d74feb3b6d5732ec4808e4929486d34125328aaca13ced2e8e66" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48F> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "A notice of opposition is taken to be filed when the notice of intention to oppose and the statement of grounds and particulars have been filed under regulations 17A.48G and 17A.48J." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
