<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48G(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:46e6e745a10ef741a1147d3e7f41eb67b96b9175b7332a0cea226013f664c887" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48G(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) For subsection 96(2) of the Act, the period for filing a notice of intention to oppose the application for cessation of protection must be filed within 2 months from the day the application for cessation of protection is published in a computer database maintained by the Trade Marks Office in accordance with subregulation 17A.48E(2)." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48G(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r17A.48G(1)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
