<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r17A.48M(3)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(3) The Registrar must decide the length of the extended period having regard to what is reasonable in the circumstances." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
