<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.12(4)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(4) If a bill of costs is filed in relation to the proceedings, the bill of costs must be filed within 3 months from the day on which the costs are awarded." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
