<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.20A> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "In this Division: notice of opposition means a notice filed under subregulation 21.20B(1). party means an applicant or opponent. Note: The definitions of the following terms are in section 6 of the Act: (a) applicant; (b) approved form; (c) file; (d) month; (e) person." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
