<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.20C(4)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.20C(4)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(4) The Registrar must notify the parties of the Registrar’s decision." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.20C(4)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r21.20C(4)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
