<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.20E(5)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(5) The Registrar must:" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.20E(5)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r21.20E(5)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
