<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.21A(3)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(3) If the Registrar or the ComptrollerGeneral of Customs notifies under regulation 21.23 the person concerned or his or her agent, that the fee has not been paid, the act is not taken to have been done, or the document is not taken to have been filed, before the day on which the fee is paid." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
