<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.4(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) If a document received for filing at the Trade Marks Office does not comply with the Act or the regulations, or is not in accordance with whichever approved form is applicable, the Registrar may treat the document:" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
