<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:9104253467f86e081b70295bbdf2a182eced83e013555d0c8f1f4b9a0d2edfb1" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) A declaration required or permitted by the Act or these Regulations must be in an approved form." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r21.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r21.6(1)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
