<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.10(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:6d942a9021c199e60f601fb583c61a349204bb4dc1ecdeaf2617aa2f80065d93" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
