<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.2(1)(c)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r4.2(1)(c)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
