<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r4.4(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) For the purposes of paragraph 27(3)(b) of the Act, the following subregulations set out the manner of specifying, in an application for the registration of a trade mark, the goods and/or services in respect of which registration is sought." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
