<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Notification and opportunity to make representations"@en-AU <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityKind> "law" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/authorityStatus> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/Current> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:78d45329728e46f25ceb02a831e465b5a55f4dcac2cb1d5a6d9983e2e7324e86" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.4> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) This regulation applies if: (a) a party makes a request to the Registrar under this Part; or (b) the Registrar proposes to make a decision on the Registrar’s own initiative under this Part. (2) The Registrar must: (a) for paragraph (1)(a)—notify the other party of the request, including by giving the other party a copy of the request; or (b) for paragraph (1)(b)—notify the parties of the proposed decision. (3) If the Registrar proposes to grant the request, the Registrar must give the parties an opportunity to make representations: (a) in writing; or (b) at a hearing; or (c) by other means that the Registrar states in the notification. (4) The Registrar must notify the parties of the decision." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
