<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) For subsection 52(2) of the Act, the period for filing a notice of intention to oppose is 2 months from the day the acceptance of the trade mark application is published in a computer database maintained by the Trade Marks Office in accordance with regulation 4.11A." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
