<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.9(4)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r5.9(4)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r5.9> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/doc/TMR1995> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
