<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r6.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/capturedIn> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/snapshot-c490a9927f1a> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r6.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/contentHash> "sha256:9b95c24b18d4f0787459271deb56332cbbcd26837c4465b162adc4c028434029" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r6.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/ordinal> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r6.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) For subsection 65A(4) of the Act, a person may oppose a request for amendment by filing a notice of opposition, in an approved form, within one month from the publication of the request for the amendment in a computer database maintained by the Trade Marks Office in accordance with regulation 6.3A." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r6.6(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r6.6(1)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
