<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r7.3> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "For the purposes of subsection 75(1) of the Act (which deals with requests for renewal), the period within which a person may request the Registrar to renew the registration of a trade mark is 12 months ending on the day on which the registration of the trade mark expires." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
