<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r7.4(1)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) For the purposes of section 76 of the Act (which deals with notice of renewal due), the period in relation to notifying a registered owner that renewal of the registration of a trade mark is due is 2 months ending on the day on which the registration of the trade mark expires." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
