<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.16(6)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(6) If the applicant files evidence in answer under subregulation (4), the opponent must file any evidence in reply to the evidence in answer within 2 months from the day the Registrar:" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.16(6)> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/upstreamRef> "TMR1995/r9.16(6)" <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
