<https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ref/TMR1995/r9.7> <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/ns/text> "(1) The components of a notice of opposition are: (a) a notice of intention to oppose; and (b) a statement of grounds and particulars. (2) A notice of opposition is taken to be filed when both of its components have been filed." <https://data.ipaustralia.gov.au/tmk/graph/source> .
